        name = "Withers",
        stepCount = 8,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - A simple Horde purchase; the Alliance route requires a substantial Darkshore quest chain.\n\n1. Travel to Darkshore. If you see the Battle for Azeroth battlefield, speak to Zidormi at 48.9,24.4 and choose the earlier Darkshore. Both routes below use that still-accessible Cataclysm version.\n\n2. Horde: enter Cliffspring Falls through the waterfall at 56.6,30.8. Follow the cave and take the left branch to Apothecary Furrows at about 57.3,33.9. Buy Withers for 50 silver and use the item. No Alliance quest chain is required.\n\n3. Alliance: begin in Lor'danel around 50.8,18.2 with The Last Wave of Survivors and The Boon of the Seas. Follow Wizbang's chain: Buzzbox 413, No Accounting for Taste, Buzzbox 723 and A Cure In The Dark. Enable trivial-quest tracking so these low-level quests remain visible.\n\n4. At Cliffspring Falls, complete The Corruption's Source and Bearer of Good Fortune. Inside the cave, inspect the Disgusting Workbench near 57.4,33.8 for A Troubling Prescription. Finish these follow-ups and return to Lor'danel for the newly available quests.\n\n5. Finish The Final Flame of Bashal'Aran and A Love Eternal, then follow A Lost Companion to Keeper Karithus near 43.0,39.0. Complete Twice Removed, Unsavory Remedies and Ritual Materials. Finish The Ritual Bond by choosing one animal spirit, then return with Grimclaw's Return.\n\n6. Take The Shatterspear Invaders from Ranger Glynda Nal'Shea and report to Morra at 58.9,19.4. Complete Shatterspear Laborers and Remnants of the Highborne, then Denying Manpower and War Supplies. Finish both On the Brink and Strategic Strikes to unlock The Front Line; doing just one leaves the next quest unavailable.\n\n7. Follow The Front Line to Huntress Sandrya Moonfall near 72.3,19.1. Accept Ending the Threat and tell her you are ready to attack; her assistance removes Jor'kil the Soulripper's protective shield. Kill him and loot Hellscream's Missive. Use the missive to start Disturbing Connections before leaving.\n\n8. Turn in Ending the Threat, then return to Ranger Glynda Nal'Shea in Lor'danel for Disturbing Connections. Find Cerellean Whiteclaw near 50.1,19.5 and complete Remembrance of Auberdine. Use the Withers reward; the missive quest is required for this final link.",
