        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - The first colour is a quest reward, but the second needs ten daily completions.\n\n1. Follow Mount Hyjal's story into the Shrine of Aviana branch near 44.3,47.9. Complete its egg and Sethria quests through Return to the Shrine and An Ancient Reborn. Take The Hatchery Must Burn, which sends you through the flamegate near 38.8,58.6 to Farden Talonshrike.\n\n2. Enter the flamegate. For Flight in the Firelands, take and equip a Twilight Firelance from the rack behind Farden, mount an Aviana's Guardian and use Flap to reach the marked flag. Finish Wave One and Wave Two by flying into the required enemies while maintaining height and avoiding hazards. For Egg Wave, run the mount over 40 eggs on the ledges, then return to Farden.\n\n3. If this character has not chosen a reward yet, select Blue Mini Jouster from Egg Wave and learn it. The quest offers a choice of colours; it does not award both at once.\n\n4. If you chose the other colour, return to Farden for Vigilance on Wings whenever available. Complete and turn in that daily ten times on the character progressing The 'Unbeatable?' Pterodactyl: BEATEN.; they do not have to be consecutive days.\n\n5. After the tenth completion, open the achievement's Chirping Box reward and learn the missing colour. Check your mail and Pet Journal before repeating the story on another character.",
