        name = "Crawling Claw",
        stepCount = 6,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Tol'vir sites are limited and discovering this rare project can take hundreds of solves.\n\n1. If you want to earn the pet yourself, train Archaeology with Harrison Jones in Stormwind Keep at 85.7,25.9 or Belloc Brightblade in Orgrimmar at 49.0,70.6. Alternatively, buy a caged Crawling Claw from another player and learn it.\n\n2. Reach Archaeology 450 to unlock Tol'vir dig sites. Survey Uldum sites and clear other Kalimdor sites when necessary to roll new locations. If Uldum is in its assault phase, Zidormi at 56.0,35.1 can return you to the earlier zone.\n\n3. Use Survey inside the red dig-site boundary, follow the indicator toward the find, and loot the fragments. Finish ordinary Tol'vir artifacts from the Archaeology window to reveal new projects. Continue until Mummified Monkey Paw is selected; another player's solve count is not a guarantee.\n\n4. Alternative to waiting for Uldum sites: reach Archaeology 600, solve common Pandaria artifacts and right-click the completed objects to crate them into Restored Artifacts. Take these to Brann Bronzebeard in the Seat of Knowledge above Mogu'shan Palace, 83.5,31.0 in the original Vale of Eternal Blossoms. Exchange them for Crates of Tol'vir Archaeology Fragments, open the crates, and solve Tol'vir projects normally. Crates supply fragments; they do not guarantee the pet project.\n\n5. To concentrate that optional farm, first reach Exalted with the Lorewalkers. Buy Brann's Mantid Artifact Hunter's Kit for 2 Restored Artifacts, open it only when ready to dig, and use its Lorewalker's Map with the Sonic Locator active. Survey the Mantid sites in Townlong Steppes and Dread Wastes, crate your common solves, then return to Brann for more Tol'vir crates. The locator lasts 24 real-time hours; do not buy the kit before meeting its reputation requirement.\n\n6. When Mummified Monkey Paw appears, collect 150 Tol'vir fragments, or fill up to 3 sockets with Tol'vir Hieroglyphics to reduce the fragment cost by 12 per socket. Solve the rare project, find Crawling Claw in your bags and use it to learn the pet.",
