        itemId = 60869,
        name = "Pebble",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - A long Deepholm unlock and ten completions of a rotating daily; the escort itself is simple.\n\n1. Enter Deepholm through your faction capital's Cataclysm portal. Finish the Temple of Earth and Earthen/Therazane story until Therazane's Throne offers daily quests. Being high level or Exalted does not replace the quest unlock on a new character.\n\n2. Check Pyrite at Therazane's Throne, around 57.3,12.5, for Lost In The Deeps. If it is absent, return after a daily reset. Accepting other dailies does not guarantee this specific one will appear.\n\n3. Enter the Crumbling Depths near 59.0,25.0. Follow behind the Colossal Gyreworm around the circular tunnel, avoiding its body, then take the exit into the large crystal chamber. Follow the right-hand passage and its left turn to Pebble's ledge near 63.2,20.8; talk to him.\n\n4. Escort him back along the tunnels on foot. Pause at corners and the low rock ramp so he follows; avoid jumping away or running far ahead. At the cave mouth wait for the rescue objective to complete before flying off. If lost, return for Pebble; leave and re-enter the cave if he does not reset.\n\n5. Turn in the daily to Pyrite. Repeat on available days until Rock Lover reaches 10/10, then check your Pet Journal and reward mail for Pebble. Learn any awarded pet item.",
