        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - The project is random, although Eastern Kingdoms has many suitable Dwarf sites.\n\n1. If you want to earn the pet yourself, train Archaeology with Harrison Jones in Stormwind Keep at 85.7,25.9 or Belloc Brightblade in Orgrimmar at 49.0,70.6. Alternatively, buy a caged Clockwork Gnome from another player and learn it.\n\n2. Enable dig sites on your world map and survey the active sites in Eastern Kingdoms. Check each find's race: only Dwarf fragments advance this project. Clear other races' sites when necessary to get new sites; a marked region does not guarantee a specific active dig.\n\n3. Use Survey inside the red dig-site boundary, follow the indicator toward the find, and loot the fragments. Finish ordinary Dwarf artifacts from the Archaeology window to reveal new projects. Continue until Clockwork Gnome is selected; another player's solve count is not a guarantee.\n\n4. When Clockwork Gnome appears, collect 100 Dwarf fragments, or fill up to 3 sockets with Dwarf Rune Stones to reduce the fragment cost by 12 per socket. Solve the rare project, find Clockwork Gnome in your bags and use it to learn the pet.",
