        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - A rotating quest supplies the reliable access method, followed by an unpredictable rare-spawn wait.\n\n1. Unlock Therazane dailies by progressing Deepholm's story. Enter the Crumbling Depths at 59.0,25.0 and look for Ricket inside near 56.0,14.2. On an Underground Economy day, accept the quest and keep its Ricket's Tickers.\n\n2. Pass the circling Colossal Gyreworm into the large central crystal chamber. Take the far-right tunnel and the first left to reach the overlook near Pebble. Locate the higher cave opening across the chamber; Jadefang is in its back near 61.2,22.6, underground.\n\n3. Aim toward Jadefang's opening, place a ticker, then stand between the bomb and your destination. Jump as it detonates so the knockback launches you into the elevated tunnel. Repeat and adjust your position if you miss; the quest item allows repeated attempts.\n\n4. Check the back of the tunnel for Jadefang. If absent, wait or return later; another player's recorded spawn time does not start a guaranteed timer for your phase. You may log out on the ledge to avoid repeating the jump.\n\n5. Kill Jadefang and loot Tiny Shale Spider, then use it. Finish Underground Economy when done with the bombs. If you prefer to bypass the spawn and access work, buy a caged Tiny Shale Spider from another player.",
