        itemId = 65364,
        name = "Horde Guild Herald",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - The correct guild unlock and the buying character's guild reputation are required.\n\n1. Use a Horde character and check that its guild has Profit Sharing. For a Page, use a guild of the matching faction: a character joining a cross-faction guild does not automatically gain the other faction's Slayer unlock.\n\n2. If Profit Sharing is unfinished, guild members must loot a combined 100,000 gold from creatures. Vendor sales, Auction House income and depositing gold in the guild bank are different activities. Joining an already-qualified guild avoids waiting for this total.\n\n3. Earn Revered reputation with that guild on the buying character through reputation-awarding quests and eligible guild activities. Check your personal Guild reputation; another member's standing does not satisfy it.\n\n4. Visit Goram at 48.2,75.6 in Orgrimmar. Choose All in the vendor filter, buy Guild Herald for 500 gold and use it on this character. Summon it from the Pet Journal while meeting its guild-use requirements.",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=65364",
    },
