        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - A short quest unlock followed by two layers of random loot.\n\n1. Find Fiona at the western entrance to Eastern Plaguelands, 9.0,66.4. Complete her Gidwin Goldbraids and Tarenar Sunstrike branches, including the quests each missing paladin gives before returning to the caravan.\n\n2. Interact with Fiona's Caravan and choose Fiona's Lucky Charm. Confirm the buff is on your character before farming. If the caravan has already moved in your story, use its current stop; the western start is for a fresh character.\n\n3. Kill and loot enemies at Corin's Crossing around 54,61 or the trolls and disturbed graves of Zul'Mashar around 63,18. Open every Hidden Stash you receive. These are alternative farming areas on the same zone map, not sequential quest requirements.\n\n4. Repeat while the charm is active until a stash contains Mr. Grubbs, then use the item. Neither the bag nor its pet is guaranteed on a particular kill. A caged Mr. Grubbs from another player bypasses the unlock and farm.",
