        itemId = 67275,
        name = "Magic Lamp",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Self-crafting needs Cataclysm Enchanting 75 and materials; buying the pet is straightforward.\n\n1. For the shortest route, compare the unused Magic Lamp item and caged Magic Lamp listings on the Auction House. Buy and learn one; neither faction nor Enchanting restricts learning the finished pet.\n\n2. To make it yourself, use a Alliance character and train Cataclysm Enchanting to 75. Bring 20 Hypnotic Dust to Jessara Cordell - Enchanting Supplies at 53.0,74.3 in Stormwind City and buy Formula: Magic Lamp.\n\n3. Learn the formula, then gather 8 Heavenly Shards, 1 Maelstrom Crystal and 4 Greater Celestial Essence. The dust paid for the formula is separate from the crafting reagents.\n\n4. Craft Magic Lamp from the Cataclysm Enchanting recipe list and use it. Alternatively, give the materials to an eligible enchanter and have them trade you the finished pet.",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=67275",
    },
