        areaMaps = { 241, 249 },
        itemId = 67282,
        name = "Elementium Geode",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Mining is simple, but the bonus pet is random and can take many nodes.\n\n1. Choose to farm with Mining or buy an unused Elementium Geode / caged Elementium Geode on the Auction House. A non-miner can learn a purchased copy.\n\n2. For farming, train Cataclysm Mining and enable mineral tracking. Search Elementium Veins and Rich Elementium Veins in Deepholm, Twilight Highlands or original Uldum. Mine suitable deposits rather than Obsidium nodes.\n\n3. Loot every mined vein and continue around the zone's cliffs, rocky edges and caves as new nodes respawn. The area north of the Temple of Earth around 51,37 is one reported Deepholm find; it is a starting search area, not a guaranteed node.\n\n4. When Elementium Geode appears in your mining loot, use the item to learn it. You do not need to enter The Stonecore, kill Corborus or prospect a stack of ore.",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=67282",
